{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 162282, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 108718, "uid": 176744, "type": 4, "title": "天子用法", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1657891114, "updated_at": 1657958523, "updated_uid": 176744, "comment_at": 1657891114, "last_at": 1668595036, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "好的，今天又是一期最最最基础的萌新相关教程了基础众所周知，一个游戏最基础的评判战力等级，就是星级。想要提升战力最快也是最有效的方法就是将一个天子升上60级满级（不排除以后有开放上限的可能）。dc现在也", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_434/1164/176744/2022/6/15/251029.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_576/h_949/1164/176744/2022/6/15/65675.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_530/h_747/1164/176744/2022/6/15/979624.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 6, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 8373, "is_top": 1, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 1, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 162282, "content": "<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; 好的，今天又是一期<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">最<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">最</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">最</span></span>基础的萌新相关教程了<br></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">基础</span></div></div><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">众所周知，一个游戏最基础的评判战力等级，就是<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">星级</span>。想要提升战力最快也是最有效的方法就是将一个天子升上60级满级（不排除以后有开放上限的可能）。dc现在也快拥有了茫茫多的天子，今天我们就来了解一下在dc中<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">基础的升级</span>和<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">突破系统</span>还有他们<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">大致都可以用来</span>干什么吧。</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">角色获取方式</span></div></div><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;dc中主要有几种角色获取方式。</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line1\"></div><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">钻石抽卡：</span>&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img data-width=\"574\" data-height=\"434\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_434/1164/176744/2022/6/15/251029.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_434/1164/176744/2022/6/15/251029.png\"></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;分为各种各样的<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">限定池</span>（吃会出现特定角色）和随时开放的宇宙池（所有角色都可以抽到，狗都不碰），消耗 1900钻石抽取一次。每次必定获得3红石，出现两名一样的或者多名一样的四星以上角色可以获得红石和金币，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">为dc天子主要来源。</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">红石抽卡：</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><img data-width=\"572\" data-height=\"384\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_572/h_384/1164/176744/2022/6/16/821869.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_572/h_384/1164/176744/2022/6/16/821869.png\"></div></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;分为各属性对应的<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">宇宙池子</span>，150红石一抽，必出五星天子。一般平时不碰攒着红石，等到<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">打折期间</span>120一抽的时候all in来获取狗粮。</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">卷以及各类箱子：</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><img data-width=\"103\" data-height=\"92\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_103/h_92/1164/176744/2022/6/16/126810.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_103/h_92/1164/176744/2022/6/16/126810.png\" style=\"width: 89px; height: 80px;\"><img data-width=\"97\" data-height=\"95\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_97/h_95/1164/176744/2022/6/16/736578.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_97/h_95/1164/176744/2022/6/16/736578.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 80px;\"><img data-width=\"93\" data-height=\"98\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_93/h_98/1164/176744/2022/6/16/511353.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_93/h_98/1164/176744/2022/6/16/511353.png\" style=\"width: 75px; height: 80px;\"><img data-width=\"106\" data-height=\"97\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_106/h_97/1164/176744/2022/6/16/568801.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_106/h_97/1164/176744/2022/6/16/568801.png\" style=\"width: 87px; height: 80px;\"><img data-width=\"103\" data-height=\"101\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_103/h_101/1164/176744/2022/6/16/531846.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_103/h_101/1164/176744/2022/6/16/531846.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 80px;\"><img data-width=\"99\" data-height=\"100\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_99/h_100/1164/176744/2022/6/16/779290.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_99/h_100/1164/176744/2022/6/16/779290.png\" style=\"width: 79px; height: 80px;\"></div></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;多为活动产出。其中各式五星卷主要产出<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">狗粮</span>，自选箱则用来<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">补齐没有的天子</span>。卷和箱子同样有获取范围，详情可点击游戏内概率查看。</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">角色用处</span></div></div><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">史莱姆：</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">经验史莱姆</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"371\" data-height=\"409\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_371/h_409/1164/176744/2022/6/16/574734.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_371/h_409/1164/176744/2022/6/16/574734.png\"><img data-width=\"82\" data-height=\"212\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_82/h_212/1164/176744/2022/6/16/481376.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_82/h_212/1164/176744/2022/6/16/481376.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 右上角有个exp的标志，各种属性都有、</div></div>\n                               </div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">进化史莱姆</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"393\" data-height=\"427\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_393/h_427/1164/176744/2022/6/16/686799.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_393/h_427/1164/176744/2022/6/16/686799.png\"><img data-width=\"99\" data-height=\"268\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_99/h_268/1164/176744/2022/6/16/482904.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_99/h_268/1164/176744/2022/6/16/482904.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">右上角有个星星的标志，其中五星史莱姆一上来1级以外，三星四星进化史莱姆入手直接满级，可进化一次后使用。进化史莱姆只有火属性。</div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;史莱姆分为经验史莱姆和突破史莱姆。经验史莱姆用来喂给天子提供大量经验快速升级，而突破史莱姆拿到的时候就是满级，可以直接进化一次去当进化狗粮。<br></div></div></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">三星角色</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 首先不管是自己研究乱斗的阵容也好去排行榜上抄也罢，先用<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">三星角色塞满乱斗场</span>，可以界限突破的<span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">优先界限突破</span>，其他的三星天子或者过多的三星天子无需过多<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\">考虑直接分解成玛瑙就行。</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">四星角色</span>：</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">和三星角色一样优先决定好阵容塞满乱斗场。与三星不同的是四星角色主要用来留着突破到五星去给<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">原生五星角色当狗粮突破到六星。</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">五星角色：</span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">可以在图鉴查询或者去群里问大佬的评价来考虑是用来做<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">点火材料的狗粮</span>还是<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">作为主力培养</span>。即使做狗粮，也十分建议至少留一只。</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><div style=\"\"><br></div><div style=\"\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">还魂</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">可以从夜世界进入。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">与国际服不同，日服只能消耗三名原生五星角色和一朵还魂花。系统会随机给你设定的几位五星角色界限突破一级。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img data-width=\"576\" data-height=\"949\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_576/h_949/1164/176744/2022/6/15/65675.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_576/h_949/1164/176744/2022/6/15/65675.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">ps：不是三命是三名，懒得改了欸嘿、</div></span></div></div>\n                               </div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">点火系统</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">消耗99点火石和一个原生五星天子制作一颗主属性对应的随机副属性石头。<div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img data-width=\"530\" data-height=\"747\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_530/h_747/1164/176744/2022/6/15/979624.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_530/h_747/1164/176744/2022/6/15/979624.png\"></div></div></div>\n                               </div><div style=\"\"><br></div><div style=\"\"><br></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div style=\"\"></div></span><div style=\"\"><br></div><br><br></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16p